      "artist": "shankar s. from Poona (pune), India, India",
      "description": "Hiroshima totally annihilated by the USA's atom bomb in 1945- picture 13 of 13: Grisly remains of childrens' dresses after the Hiroshima atom bomb attack, displayed in the Peace Memorial museum in Hiroshima. Detailed notes about the USA's atom bomb attack over Hiroshima and other details appeared earlier in this album. (see previous pictures) (Hiroshima,Japan, Apr/ May 2019)",
